          "mcqs": "Q1. Which option is most directly associated with “Colonial encounter”?\nA. Colonial encounter\nB. Postcolonialism and psychology\nC. Lack of distinct disciplinary identity\nD. None of the above\nAnswer: Colonial encounter\nExplanation: Review the micro-topic note for the defining feature, key distinction and application.\n\nQ2. Which option is most directly associated with “Postcolonialism and psychology”?\nA. Postcolonialism and psychology\nB. Colonial encounter\nC. Lack of distinct disciplinary identity\nD. None of the above\nAnswer: Postcolonialism and psychology\nExplanation: Review the micro-topic note for the defining feature, key distinction and application.\n\nQ3. Which option is most directly associated with “Lack of distinct disciplinary identity”?\nA. None of the above\nB. Lack of distinct disciplinary identity\nC. Colonial encounter\nD. Postcolonialism and psychology\nAnswer: Lack of distinct disciplinary identity\nExplanation: Review the micro-topic note for the defining feature, key distinction and application.",
