          "title": "Motivation and Learning in Schools",
          "explanation": "Study how motivational and learning principles can be translated into educational practice.",
          "notes": "ACADEMIC CORE\nStudy how motivational and learning principles can be translated into educational practice.\n\nMICRO-TOPIC MAP\nApplications of motivation theories in school • Applications of learning theories in school\n\nSOURCE BASIS\nThe topic is retained within the uploaded NET syllabus/material framework. Use the listed source books/notes below for the detailed treatment; the website should not substitute generic explanations where the source is silent.\n\nEXAM USE\nLearn the definitions, named theorists/models, classifications, mechanisms, distinctions and source-specific examples actually present in the material.",
