          "pyqs": "PYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 1\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Needs for school guidance”?\nA. None of the above\nB. Needs for school guidance\nC. Organizational setup for school guidance\nD. School guidance techniques\nAnswer: Needs for school guidance\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.\n\nPYQ-STYLE PRACTICE 2\nQ. Which option is most directly associated with “Organizational setup for school guidance”?\nA. None of the above\nB. Organizational setup for school guidance\nC. Needs for school guidance\nD. School guidance techniques\nAnswer: Organizational setup for school guidance\nNote: Generated from the source framework; this is PYQ-style practice, not a verified past-year question.",
